    "body": "## Description\n\nFixes the reset lifecycle after deleting all app data. The bridge now replaces the process-global Whitenoise handle safely, waits for in-flight bridge calls before closing the old database, installs a fresh `Whitenoise::new(...)` instance before returning, and releases lifecycle permits before long-lived stream receive loops.\n\nAlso guards the start-DM flow after data reset by validating any cached DM group id before opening it. If the cached group no longer exists in Rust/MDK state, the app falls back to creating a fresh DM instead of opening a stale group and failing with `Group not found`.\n\nCloses #660\n\n## Type of Change\n\n- [ ] ✨ New feature (non-breaking change which adds functionality)\n- [x] 🛠️ Bug fix (non-breaking change which fixes an issue)\n- [ ] ❌ Breaking change (fix or feature that would cause existing functionality to change)\n- [ ] 🧹 Code refactor\n- [ ] ✅ Build configuration change\n- [ ] 📝 Documentation\n- [ ] 🗑️ Chore\n- [x] 🧪 Tests\n\n## How I Tested This\n\n- `cargo test --locked`\n- `just precommit` passes.\n- Ran the app on my phone, created chats, sent messages, deleted app data, and logged in again.\n- After deleting app data and logging in again, searched for a user and started a DM without hitting the stale `Group not found` path.\n\n## Screenshots\n\nNot applicable; no UI layout changes.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] `just precommit` passes\n- [x] Related issue linked (`Closes #660`)\n- [x] `CHANGELOG.md` updated (if user-visible change)\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Improvements**\n  * Async initialization and explicit lifecycle handling improve stability for chats, messages, notifications, and user streams.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Deleting all app data no longer reuses a closed database instance, preventing post‑delete errors.\n\n* **Behavior Changes**\n  * “Delete all data” no longer uses a client-side timeout and now waits for the long‑running operation to complete.\n\n* **Tests**\n  * Updated tests to validate the new delete‑all‑data behavior.\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/marmot-protocol/whitenoise/pull/662)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n",
